      "english": "you certainly know only a little of Brahman’s form—"
    },
    {
      "start": 12,
      "end": 18,
      "sanskrit": "यत् अस्य त्वम् यत् अस्य देवेषु",
      "iast": "yat asya tvam yat asya deveṣu",
      "english": "that [form] of it which you [are], and that among the gods."
    },
    {
      "start": 18,
      "end": 23,
      "sanskrit": "अथ नु मीमांस्यम् एव ते",
